# --- Secrets: never tracked (2026-09-10 security close-out) -----------------
# The old committed keys were rotated; the files stay on disk locally but must
# never re-enter git. Purging the OLD key from git *history* requires a
# one-time `git filter-repo` on main (manual step — see FINAL_MIGRATION_REPORT.md).
*secret_key*
.env

